==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Fletchinder|17}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
* '''Fire Wing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Moltres|S2}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 2}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

